      "created_at": "2024-08-31T16:15:04.647Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I search about how to export custom field  on google but I found information about how to export doctype<br>\ndata to excel<br>\nbut I did not found info how to export just the customize field from doctype<br>\ncan you please explain more for me  how to export .</p>",
