      "id": 433072,
      "username": "rahib",
      "name": "Rahib Hassan",
      "created_at": "2024-09-03T13:32:20.874Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Please refer to the <a href=\"https://frappeframework.com/docs/user/en/guides/app-development/how-to-create-custom-fields-during-app-installation\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">documentation on fixtures</a></p>\n<p>There is also one other way:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Customize Form → Select DocType → Add custom Field</li>\n<li>On the top click on <code>Actions</code> → <code>Export Customizations</code>.</li>\n<li>Choose your custom app in <code>Module to export</code></li>\n<li>Check <code>Sync on migrate</code> option → Submit</li>\n</ol>\n<p>This will create a json file with the field details and when you install your app on different site you will be able to see the changes.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/rahib/{size}/77328_2.png",
